OL,3,GNEWSATributes to landlord who helped
OL,4,Ashape the Desi pub culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a West
OL,7,FBromwich pub owner who helped shape the
OL,8,FBlack Country's Desi pub culture and
OL,9,Fbrought generations of families
OL,10,Ftogether.
OL,12,FThe family of Suresh "Suki" Patel, who
OL,13,Fran The Vine in West Bromwich,
OL,14,Fannounced his passing on Friday, from a
OL,15,Fshort illness. He has been remembered
OL,16,Ffor his contribution to the local
OL,17,Fcommunity and the culinary legacy he
OL,18,Fleft behind.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
