OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSATributes to landlord who helped
OL,4,Ashape the Desi pub culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FJag Nijjer, who spoke about Patel's
OL,7,Finfluence, said The Vine was far more
OL,8,Fthan a restaurant, describing it as a
OL,9,Fplace that brought together people from
OL,10,Fdifferent cultures, religions and
OL,11,Fgenerations.
OL,13,F"He didn't just feed the community, he
OL,14,Fhelped bring people together.
OL,15,FRestaurants come and go, but this was
OL,16,Fan institution," Nijjer said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
